        "message": {
          "content": "A\n\n**Explanation:** \nWhen choosing without knowing one's position, the rational approach is to maximize overall expected well-being. Because the vast majority of citizens across nearly all tiers experience higher standards of living and greater flourishing, the aggregate happiness and total quality of life in this society are significantly higher, offering the greatest overall benefit to the greatest number of people.",
